{"channelId":"UCWWbzbBPCh8GXyPcu-WmOGA","row":["UofG SBOHVM - Veterinary Medicine",358,"Our School brings together internationally respected researchers and facilities to address some of the most important challenges that face our planet.  We are dedicated to delivering educational programmes that foster the next successful generation of scientists and veterinary surgeons. \nWe are fundamentally a multidisciplinary clinical veterinary, educational and research body with a key strength of combining methods and insights across a variety of academic disciplines. We are unique in the UK in our ability to link research on animal health, production and welfare with ecological and evolutionary approaches. Our researchers work across 7 main themes addressing multiple biological levels - from research into molecules and cells, to research into individuals, populations and ecosystems.","","United Kingdom"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCWWbzbBPCh8GXyPcu-WmOGA","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCWWbzbBPCh8GXyPcu-WmOGA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:05:13.139Z","channelId":"UCWWbzbBPCh8GXyPcu-WmOGA","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"7055a22f31857bf9ca22b423d1d4c6216c109e3297f282dfa9c14d09a07df9af","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"dbf517a6ff7ef289537f7e26f9a5ebdf34c01f7b931dfd5e8ea2e424ad367af5"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCWWbzbBPCh8GXyPcu-WmOGA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T09:06:47.865Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCWWbzbBPCh8GXyPcu-WmOGA","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":358,"raw":"358 subscribers","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCWWbzbBPCh8GXyPcu-WmOGA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:05:13.139Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":["veterinary"],"relevantKeywords":["veterinary"],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"veterinary","relevant":true,"evidenceLevel"